Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.19,Default,Girl 1,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:13.05,Default,Girl 2,0,0,0,,You didn't hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.60,Default,Girl 1,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:58.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\c&HB8B74C&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\\clip(160,82,167,129)\t(16,893,1 \clip(153,76,277,123))\pos(164,88)\fad(1,187)}Wash {\c&H121A2E&}It
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:58.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\clip(269,73,271,114)\pos(282,71)\fad(1,187)\clip(267,73,276,116)\t(6,1007,1,\clip(275,58,417,107)\c&H121A2E&}All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:11.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(366,309)}Episode{\c&H8065C7&} 10 {\c&H020201}   A {\c&HA49F43&}Top-Class {\c&H020201&}Challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.99,Default - Top,Worker 1,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:11.99,Default - Top,Worker 2,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:17.70,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Boy, what a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:15.58,Default - Top,Worker,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.05,Default - Top,Worker,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:22.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It even broke the patio roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:27.25,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Well, I know it's not actually your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:32.80,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,That said, I'm still gonna have to \Nadd the repair cost to your rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:35.10,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:36.66,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:42.64,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Here you go. Do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:46.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, of course! I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:53.37,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I know plenty of other shops that are \Njust as cheap and fast as yours, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:55.50,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:58.69,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Just kidding. Kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:01.33,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Aji-san is always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:08.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H4AAEBA&\3c&H867462&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:10.60,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But it is very kind of her to let me \Nrent this shop for such low rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:19.05,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kinme-san! I really need \Nyour help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:24.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Yagara-san. What happened? \NShouldn't you be at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:25.06,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.72,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Did something happen to your shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:32.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,During the big storm the other day, \Nlightning struck a tree in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:36.66,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you serious? That's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:39.33,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,That storm sure was something, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:44.33,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Power went out at my run-down apartment, \Nso nobody could use the shared bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:46.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:50.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, so what did you \Nwant to ask me, Yagara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:54.80,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Would you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:04:00.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I-Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:07.10,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Yup. Sumi ink. I stupidly got some on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:11.98,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I tried to wipe it off with a tissue, \Nbut that didn't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! There's some on your left sleeve too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:17.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It must have brushed against the skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.28,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.01,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:27.25,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Things just aren't going my way today. \NAnd September's only just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:29.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:29.96,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,How long has it been since it got stained?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:38.92,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's see. It was this morning, \Nso about three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:42.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Then we have to deal with it \Nright this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:43.64,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:47.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Treating sumi ink stains \Nis a race against time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:53.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Speaking from personal experience, \Nthey're even worse than squid ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, squid ink stains are also difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:59.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but of all the kinds of stains out there, \Nsumi ink is a top-class challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\shad0\pos(74,29)\c&H65626A&\3c&HF4F5F7&\fad(187,1)\fnTimes New Roman}Sumi Ink
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs11\shad0\c&H65626A&\3c&HF4F5F7&\fad(187,1)\pos(100,153)\b1}Kinme
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs11\shad0\c&H65626A&\3c&HF4F5F7&\fad(187,1)\pos(100,214)\b1}Wakana
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22\shad0\c&H65626A&\3c&HF4F5F7&\fad(187,1)\pos(151,108)\b1\fnTimes New Roman}Challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:03.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There are several different \Nkinds of stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\move(483,71,483,-20)\frz21.57\c&H3D485C&\3c&HF6F8F4&}Resin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:06.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H303846&\3c&HE8E1A1&\move(338,178,338,-10)\frz0.9001}Water-soluble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:08.14,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H1D3F37&\3c&H87F1B0&\move(184,250,184,-20)\frz349.1}Dye
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:08.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H2E4257&\3c&HD9F9FB&\frz350.2\move(451,258,453,-20)}Bleach
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:09.83,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H303846&\3c&H6FEAF5&\frz0.9001\move(338,332,338,0)}Oil-soluble
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.94,0:05:06.08,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Ooh, time for another knowledge drop!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.08,0:05:09.49,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,We can separate them \Ninto a few main categories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:09.83,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H31363F&\3c&HBE9CF2&\frz23.14\move(205,335,205,162,0,2979)}Protein
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.83,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H212123&\3c&HD788CE&\frz0.9001\move(338,340,338,205)}Insoluble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H303846&\3c&HE8E1A1&\an8\fad(1,351)}Water-soluble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H2D475D&\3c&HCCEAF5&\an8\fs12\pos(188,206)\fad(1,351)}Alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H2D475D&\3c&H63A2E4&\an8\fs10\pos(388,196)\fad(1,351)}Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H0D1E3A&\3c&H6482DE&\an8\fs8\pos(447,263)\fad(1,351)}Soy Sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Water-soluble stains dissolve in water...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:18.30,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H303846&\3c&H6FEAF5&\fad(394,1)\an8}Oil-soluble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:18.30,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H141490&\3c&H52926D&\an8\fs9\fad(394,1)\pos(294,228)}Vegetable Oil
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:18.30,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H263C59&\3c&H50DFF5&\an8\fs8\fad(394,1)\pos(346,239)}Sesame\NOil
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.33,0:05:16.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,while oil-soluble stains dissolve in oil.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Those are two main types.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:23.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But there are also stains that \Ndon't dissolve easily in water or oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:28.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Those are called "insoluble," and the \Nbest-known example of that is sumi ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:29.85,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:33.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It is extremely difficult to clean \Nstains like these at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.81,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:40.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And ink stains get harder to remove \Nthe longer they sit untreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:45.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So before I get started, \NI feel I must warn you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:49.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,that I may not be able \Nto remove the ink completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:52.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There is a risk \Na faint stain might remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:58.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If that happens, I will return the clothes \Nwithout charging you for the cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:01.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What would you like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:04.34,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:09.26,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Of course I want you to clean them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:11.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,H-Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:12.31,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:17.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh... don't take them off here! \NTh-There are people around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:24.14,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Come on. It's fine! I even brought \Na change of clothes with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.44,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You've got to start cleaning \Nthis instant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:29.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Whoa! Y-Yagara-san, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:33.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Go inside and change in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:35.11,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Aww, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:40.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I will take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:44.51,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Okay. Do your best, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:45.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:48.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.41,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.01,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,We've finished removing the fallen tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:26.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:27.80,Default,Worker,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:37.75,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Looks like two or three tries \Nisn't going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:40.21,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Oh, maybe I'll give that a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:56.24,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Sumi ink is very resistant \Nto chemical treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:59.32,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,If I can get another material \Nto absorb some of the ink
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.84,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,and do that over and over...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.92,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,then bit by bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.20,Default,Student,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:38.33,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, goodbye! Take care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:43.09,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I feel bad! I didn't mean to \Nmake you come all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:46.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, you have your hands full \Nwith the new term.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:47.87,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:48.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.28,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Wow! It's all gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:55.85,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Amazing! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:00.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:04.36,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:08.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There's still a faint stain left \Non part of the skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:11.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It was beyond my abilities as a cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:13.24,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.08,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:19.15,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I can barely even see it! \NIt's totally okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:22.66,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. \NSo what do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I cannot accept payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:27.25,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:30.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was unable to do my job \Nand remove it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:32.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,As such, I cannot accept payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:38.68,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NI'm totally satisfied with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:42.84,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But it's 99 percent gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:50.78,Italics,Yagara (M),0,0,0,,She sure can be stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:56.68,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Then how's this? I'll bring you another \Ntasty gift instead. Whaddya say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.82,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:07.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\shad0\c&H41474E&\3c&HE9EBF0&}Praying Mantis\N{\b0\fs16}Year Three, Class One\N Katakuchi Nairo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:07.04,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I was able to write "praying mantis"!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:10.62,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Please take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:16.05,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Kinme-oneesan! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:20.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Yagara-san, \Nare you and Nairo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:23.06,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,She is my homeroom teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.19,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,She's a student in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:26.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:32.15,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Katakuchi-san, how many of these have you \Nbrought me since class this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.95,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,This is the fifth one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:36.76,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,The fifth one already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:37.67,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:39.37,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Rather impressive, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:42.70,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Does that mean the sumi ink \Non your clothes was from...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:46.06,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,What? No, I spilled it on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:54.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(79,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:59.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(419,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:05.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Hatsuayu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you \Ncoming over to pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:11.73,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Not at all. It's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:14.49,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I'm the one who invited you \Nto lunch, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:22.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I get to see your place \Nand enjoy your home cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:27.08,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Well, you've already done so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:29.88,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,E-Especially for my social skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:40.51,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Th-The rest of the family is \Nat a memorial service today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.98,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,so I'm the only one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:46.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You decided not to go with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:50.40,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Uh, yes. We need to have \Nat least one person at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:59.16,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Uh... right. You see, there's something \NI forgot to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:04.41,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,M-My family has, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:17.80,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,S-Stop that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:26.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,E-Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:33.22,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Y-You don't have to worry. \NKonatsu and Dai are very gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:38.32,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,K-Kinme-san, are you \Ncomfortable around large dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:40.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:45.45,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But I sweat a lot, \Nso I wonder if they smell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:54.34,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,K-Kinme-san, what time did you \Nhave to be back at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:58.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. Half past two,\N so there's still plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:02.84,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-It'll be ready soon, \Nso please wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:05.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:27.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Whoa! No! Not... Not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:32.63,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh? Kinme-san, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:34.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nothing. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:38.27,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Big dogs sure are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:40.24,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:45.85,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,B-Because it's my job, I can't help \Nbut notice the dirt and dog hair
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:50.18,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,on this sofa cover and rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:14:00.90,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting. \NPlease come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:06.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:10.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever had \Nauthentic paella before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:15.66,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Well, it's actually a quickie recipe \Nthat uses a rice cooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:18.67,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I don't think you can call it authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:25.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You know, I was actually getting a little \Nworried that you weren't eating properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:26.41,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, remember Hatsushima?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:31.77,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It's so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:35.51,Flashback,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,It's been so long since \NI've had a proper meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:41.12,Flashback Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,What does Hatsuayu-san usually eat anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:45.49,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm sorry to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:51.18,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Actually, cooking has always been \None thing that I really enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:56.00,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,But I've been so busy recently, \NI haven't been able to cook much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:02.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, if you don't mind, I'll dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:08.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:15.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh my. We're being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:24.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The carpaccio is delicious too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:29.18,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,The fish is sea bass I bought down \Nat the seafood market.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:33.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh? I do a lot of shopping \Nat the seafood market too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.32,0:15:37.42,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh? I wonder if we've crossed \Npaths there before!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:45.80,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you \Nfor coming today and, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:48.93,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,actually, for every day \NI see you at the public bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:49.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:52.27,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Thanks to your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:57.15,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,my social skills are getting better, \Nso I'm having less trouble at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:16:02.19,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I think I'm learning to enjoy \Nmy job a lot more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:06.92,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,A-Actually, I don't think I've ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:11.71,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,invited a stranger over\N to my place before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:13.83,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,This might be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:21.19,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I always tended to be withdrawn \Nat school, and kind of a homebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:26.76,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,so I'm a little surprised at myself \Nfor being able to pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:33.85,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I think that since meeting you, \NI've started to change a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:38.24,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh. What am I rambling about anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:42.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:44.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You're wrong about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:51.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,We aren't strangers anymore. \NWe are definitely friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:03.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal! \NIt really was a delicious lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:07.51,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all. \NWell, I guess I'll drive you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:12.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Where did the dogs go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:13.51,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:23.41,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Th-The sliding glass door...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:28.58,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I must have totally forgotten to latch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:34.03,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!\N S-Stop playing with the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:39.54,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Oh, now you're both such a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:44.04,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Konatsu, Dai, you really have to behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:47.55,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't put your paw on my skirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Let me give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:12.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Bye! See you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:04.96,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it got so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:12.38,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,We haven't had a new guest\N over in a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.47,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,so the dogs got a little excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:20.22,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,They even got your blouse dirty.\N You have to go back to work now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:23.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's okay. I can change \Ninto something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:32.11,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,They took me by surprise at first, \Nbut the dogs sure were adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:37.80,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,So, about the sofa cover, \Nis this really okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:40.62,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Are you sure you really \Ndon't want me to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:44.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You treated me to a really \Nwonderful time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Think of it as my way of saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:48.76,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Then thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:06.14,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Okay, then. Thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:07.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:12.52,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,I-I guess I'll see you at the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:15.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course! Thank you again for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:27.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Aji-san! Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:28.67,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:30.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.99,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I came to check out the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:38.81,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,The repair men sure are dragging \Ntheir feet. What are they up to anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:42.05,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I wish they'd shake \Na leg and get it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:48.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're busy around town with \Nall the damage caused by the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:49.90,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.52,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,The heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:02.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. That's a paw print from a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:07.36,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,My! So you spent your lunch break \Nplaying with dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:12.06,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I bet if I leave my laundry \Nfor you to wash,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:16.30,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,everything will come back \Nwith a paw stamp on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:19.13,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Same old, same old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:20.38,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:22.03,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:25.83,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Well, I saw what I needed to, so I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.87,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,She tries not to show it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:32.26,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,but she was so worried about me \Nthat she came to check the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:38.36,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,It's already past two thirty now. \NDo you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:39.99,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:43.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I-I need to go change, \Nso please give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.79,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(443,259.783)}Translation:\NEditing and Typesetting:
