Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.07,0:23:19.96,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:30.01,Default,Hatsuayu,0,0,0,,Wakana-san i-isn't coming over today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(319,155)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}11{\c&H020201} To Help This {\c&HA49F43&}Little Guy {\c&H020201&}Out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:38.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time, "To Help This Little Guy Out."
